Why Use Candlesticks in Time Series Analysis?

Time Series Analysis studies data over time.

For stock markets:

Day 1 → Candlestick
Day 2 → Candlestick
Day 3 → Candlestick
Day 4 → Candlestick
...

By analyzing many candlesticks, traders try to predict future price movements.

=========

Example

Monday    🟢
Tuesday   🟢
Wednesday 🟢
Thursday  🔴
Friday    🟢

This sequence helps identify:

Upward trend 📈
Downward trend 📉
Market behavior

